{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05674","headline":"奉和李右相赏会昌林亭 · 孙逖","name":"奉和李右相赏会昌林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤相初陪跸，灵山本降神。\n作京雄近县，开阁宠平津。\n地胜林亭好，时清宴赏频。\n百泉萦草木，万井布郊畛。\n德与春和盛，功将造化邻。\n还嗤渭滨叟，岁晚独垂纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}